+         row  `WriteUnsupported`  11  _TAR archives cannot yet be opened for writing_  un `open[Tar]` con un modo `Write`; para escribir, úsese `create[Tar]` o escríbase un `Tarfile`
+         row  `AlreadyExists`  12  _an archive already exists at this path_  `create[Tar]` sin `CreateFlag.Replace`
